title: A Party Congress
subtitle: One of the Senate's blocs meets to decide who leads it.
tags: event
view-if: congress_go = 1
priority: 2
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_senate.svg
on-arrival: {! SW.prepareCongress(Q); !}
on-display: {! if (typeof SW !== 'undefined' && SW.drawCongress) SW.drawCongress(Q, 'congress_chart'); !}

= Congress of the [+ cg_bloc_name +]

[+ cg_intro +]

{!<svg id="congress_chart" class="congress-chart" style="width: 500px; height: 260px;"></svg>!}

[+ cg_table +]

- @back1: Back [+ cg_c1_cand +] of the [+ cg_c1_name +].
- @back2: Back [+ cg_c2_cand +] of the [+ cg_c2_name +].
- @back3: Back [+ cg_c3_cand +] of the [+ cg_c3_name +].
- @back4: Back [+ cg_c4_cand +] of the [+ cg_c4_name +].
- @adv: Ask [+ cg_adv_name +] to work their connections for the [+ cg_adv_wing_name +].
- @promise: [+ cg_offer +], to help [+ cg_soft +].
- @stay_out: Stay out of it.

@back1
view-if: cg_c1
choose-if: cg_can_pay
unavailable-subtitle: Needs [+ cg_cost +] political capital.
subtitle: [+ cg_cost_txt +]
on-arrival: {! SW.resolveCongress(Q, 'back', 1); !}
go-to: cg_ballot

@back2
view-if: cg_c2
choose-if: cg_can_pay
unavailable-subtitle: Needs [+ cg_cost +] political capital.
subtitle: [+ cg_cost_txt +]
on-arrival: {! SW.resolveCongress(Q, 'back', 2); !}
go-to: cg_ballot

@back3
view-if: cg_c3
choose-if: cg_can_pay
unavailable-subtitle: Needs [+ cg_cost +] political capital.
subtitle: [+ cg_cost_txt +]
on-arrival: {! SW.resolveCongress(Q, 'back', 3); !}
go-to: cg_ballot

@back4
view-if: cg_c4
choose-if: cg_can_pay
unavailable-subtitle: Needs [+ cg_cost +] political capital.
subtitle: [+ cg_cost_txt +]
on-arrival: {! SW.resolveCongress(Q, 'back', 4); !}
go-to: cg_ballot

@adv
view-if: cg_adv
choose-if: cg_adv_ok
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted.
subtitle: Uses our advisors' action. Their friends in the bloc will remember it.
on-arrival: {! SW.resolveCongress(Q, 'adv'); !}
go-to: cg_ballot

@promise
view-if: cg_soft_wing
subtitle: No capital, but the promise will cost us inside the Caucus.
on-arrival: {! SW.resolveCongress(Q, 'promise'); !}
go-to: cg_ballot

@stay_out
subtitle: The bloc settles its own affairs.
on-arrival: {! SW.resolveCongress(Q, ''); !}
go-to: cg_ballot

@cg_ballot
new-page: true
on-display: {! if (typeof SW !== 'undefined' && SW.drawCongress) SW.drawCongress(Q, 'congress_chart2'); !}

= The First Ballot

{!<svg id="congress_chart2" class="congress-chart" style="width: 500px; height: 260px;"></svg>!}

[+ cg_table +]

[+ cg_analysis +]

[+ cg_box +]

[? if not cg_deadlock : [+ cg_result +] ?]

[? if not cg_deadlock : [+ cg_effect +] ?]

- @cg_round2: Continue...

@cg_round2
view-if: cg_deadlock
new-page: true

= Congress Deadlocked

[+ cg_round2 +]

[+ cg_result +]

[+ cg_effect +]
